{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":91017,\"title\":\"Heartbreak Hotel\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Episodic series about love and its many manifestations set around the Navras or the Nine Emotions. Each episode will look at one of the emotions from the perspective of love. The entire series is set in a secluded, sleepy town like Matheran and revolves around an old Hotel called HEARTBREAK HOTEL by its employees as love always seems to be unrequited by its visitors.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5r2kxMLdgJ3nA42uoR9mMvtJwFa.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ZBwFoU0vRYg/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2019,\"genres\":[],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":9,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"SonyLIV\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IN\",\"name\":\"India\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2019-08-13\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2711259,\"name\":\"Raj Parmar\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2711260,\"name\":\"Ravi Pannu\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2711261,\"name\":\"Parthaa Akerkar\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2706637,\"name\":\"Saloni Khanna\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7P4yXZvV6eg5WmPWR6sresLgsWJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":930300,\"name\":\"Palak Jain\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xfJH1zf9kOkMTzZjnF952ceXuun.jpg\"},{\"id\":1473707,\"name\":\"Suhaas Ahuja\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6p54Abv8ww2Tn5sbIY4aTTdGjd9.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"ZBwFoU0vRYg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"w1ym1k-C2Ug\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"21yxOHPCFdI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dLIqjAnvG9K8ciA2q6iJ4WylomZ.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2019-06-18\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Phenomenal\",\"overview\":\"A con artist specializing in conning rich women realizes after trying to con a mother-daughter duo that this time he was merely an actor in someone else's script.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qvsxjqwQ0FNNYH0gOw1zGFjJDiH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-18\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Horror\",\"overview\":\"An incorrigible cheater brings an innocent girl to the hotel to have a fun night with her. The fun turns to horror when the spirit of another cheated girl starts having fun with him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8f3svU4mA44WkrnuRt1sJd5JYPN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-25\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Peace\",\"overview\":\"A fugitive hides in the room of a blind girl on a stormy night when all the power has gone from the area. She teaches him that it is necessary, sometimes, to close your eyes in order to see things clearly.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fnBzgxHZ0fSWLUGu5NsjIx3hjr5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-02\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Valour\",\"overview\":\"A middle-aged woman gathers the courage to break free from her loveless marriage after a chance meeting with her old lover.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5SlhEkOY5nNRRK65hrkiT1CpTLh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-09\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Disgust\",\"overview\":\"A young girl teaches her businessman father a lesson when he treats her marriage as another profitable business deal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k3hoFSgm0rqW665ik6ASjodnSBN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Sorrow\",\"overview\":\"A young woman after having lost everything she had gives up on life, but the realization that she is going to be a mother and the compassion for her inborn prepares her to fight against her tormentors.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/90CC3ld0hSzGW4UsACIpNS2R3R2.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-23\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Humour\",\"overview\":\"A pathological liar meets a girl with anger issues, especially against liars.  His lying and her anger save the hotel from going bust.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kJt4hbEdqrUAzVuUWlnqaJRob6A.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-30\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Anger\",\"overview\":\"An angry father torments the doctor responsible for his sons death by kidnapping his daughter.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/98bMVuxUiN9RWXkxdR1nrQlSjXa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-06\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Love\",\"overview\":\"The perception of love changes for everyone in the hotel when they protect an absconding couple from getting killed by their own relatives.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8kEQNRYQx6rjiUoHELf9DcDFfP8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-13\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-06-18\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}